      "writtenOn": "2022-06-07T10:25:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The order shouldn\u0027t matter here, since notifying driver has no dependency with opening the channel to audio server.\n\nHowever talking about racing, we still have a long sleep on audio server side to make sure it starts send/read data after driver and domain socket are ready.\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/chromeos_public/src/third_party/adhd/cras/src/server/cras_hfp_manager.c;rcl\u003dfa09ee87ca54b8b25b5ee46a20fb9e5430841bec;l\u003d119",
